    "CPU panel has a common nominal16second learning budget; actual overshoot, updates and complete process costs must be reported, not silently relabeled as exact equal actual CPU.",
    "Historical content pretraining is a shared frozen input; new-study marginal costs do not measure retraining an entire general model.",
    "Frozen efficacy, complete model seal, raw confirmation outcomes and fitted native execution remain unobserved by this review. No scientific benefit or production admission is granted."
  ],
